{"version":1,"key":"card:503","content":{"id":503,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8c7b2e1e-769c-415c-8279-e0558b2394fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"var"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明变量有三个特点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"128fb751-62af-4135-bbea-8d728eb88250","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7b10b960-f394-4cc5-ae35-4b1f2daacaf4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"650fc874-96ab-4e50-a415-2e108015385f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"声明提升"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"65b25cb9-67b4-472d-b6cf-4dc5c54f64ec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"正常情况下，变量需要先声明才能使用，如果在声明之前使用了还未定义的变量，那么会报错，但是在 JavaScript 中，对于使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"var"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明的变量，可以在声明之前访问，因为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"var"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明的变量其作用域会提升到其所在作用域的顶部，不过只有声明会被提升，变量的初始化不会提升，因此在初始化之前访问的值是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"undefined"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，在初始化之后访问才能获取到值"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"4660a8ff-7a65-4138-addf-00444778c3b7","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f5be368e-500c-495e-9323-fbc8ec3a312a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"console.log(a); // undefined，在变量 a 定义之前访问，不会报错，访问到的是 undefined\nvar a = 10;\nconsole.log(a); // 10，在定义之后访问，可以访问到初始的值","collabId":"e9dd1ced-1ed5-499c-8111-a304f5643bb3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"79983ac2-3e50-4f92-bcb8-c5a7a9cc4e46","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的语句相当于"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"1ba87c3b-d98b-481f-a47f-f47325ac6b07","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"824bbf0e-5b39-46fa-91bc-9cc0ecc0b82b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"var a; // 声明提升\nconsole.log(a); // undefined\na = 10;\nconsole.log(a); // 10","collabId":"037323b4-f107-4f2c-992e-214964b69353","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"438aea84-688a-4212-8eb9-68973b045888","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a9bbd4c8-9185-4548-a364-9395361d2a71","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无块级作用域"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9c5c7e13-7483-4f0e-9714-20f0b0bdb6bd","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"var"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明的变量的作用域是离其最近的"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"函数主体"},{"type":"formatted","text":"或"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"类静态初始化块"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，在除此之外的块作用域中，如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"if"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"for"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"while"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"try...catch"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"switch"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等块级作用域中声明的变量可以在其外部访问到"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"eb260837-b298-4184-88a5-651918029f01","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"aff550b6-03d1-4e11-a88d-5a8d08ed7315","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"var a = true;\n\nif (a) {\n    var b = 2;\n}\n\nconsole.log(b); // 2，如果 a 是 false，那么这里访问到的就是 undefined","collabId":"c4d124e9-645f-4143-a83a-695b37d333b1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"ab6ecad0-ad94-4eee-86e0-742ca186a327","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"de05311b-9775-4ace-b870-fa16ed673ce6","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function func () {\n  // 变量 a 的作用域在 func 内，因此在函数外无法访问到 a\n  var a = 1;\n}\n\nfunc();\n\nconsole.log(a); // ReferenceError: a is not defined","collabId":"af6ef514-2f6f-44e3-89c9-e5b00ef4a1a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"499a043a-14eb-497e-a926-6a9df9b952ad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果不是在函数或类静态初始化块中使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"var"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明变量，分为两种情况："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"27f073f2-a576-42ee-b618-f1df0b89c588","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"18d8d8c2-95b6-46b3-a6f1-b5103ca2fe56","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"443c9565-6407-4f2f-bf44-4c90cdafbbd9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果在模块中，那么 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"var"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的作用域就是整个模块"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"69ee7904-e0ef-480c-a9e6-8089eb4a6318","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5b2027b5-9cb5-45ee-8128-da39f7e95ebd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果是在脚本中，那么就是全局作用域"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"20336004-9718-47a5-a27f-2d752768c093","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果是全局作用域，声明的变量将作为全局对象的"},{"type":"formatted","color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","bold":true,"text":"不可配置属性"},{"type":"formatted","text":"（对于浏览器环境，对应于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"windows"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性，对于 Node 环境，就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"global"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性）"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"8620f27a-9a2c-4bef-84de-69b286fe75ba","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f2869925-d2cc-4883-b9d7-7d2a27f7a67f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"var a = 1;\nconsole.log(window.a); // 1\n\ndelete window.a; // false，不可配置","collabId":"57b3104f-5448-4a1c-9eff-d409961443e0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"22c81d0c-6d58-488f-a8a7-c2dd4e289bf5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f4353563-3873-488f-91c2-b51723df95fc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"重复声明"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f863e10c-4623-42fd-97fe-4a24a358e535","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在同一个作用域中，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"var"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明的变量可重复声明，重新声明后值也不会丢失，除非重新进行了初始化"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"ec6992b5-da19-478d-a4f4-17d874d096b8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"52f78d9f-de51-410a-86ef-a7cfd58ac759","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"var a = 1;\nconsole.log(a); // 1\n\nvar a;\nconsole.log(a); // 1\n\na = 10;\nconsole.log(a); // 10","collabId":"39aa69fa-7f6a-4874-858d-126b5674a1f7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"679e5ef9-a237-4082-8491-a73a34fd7f30","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"var"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"function"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在同一作用域声明了同一变量，那么 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"var"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 初始化会覆盖 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"function"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值，因为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"function"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的声明会被提升到作用域的顶部，随后才是变量的初始化"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"c5a5c02b-820b-447d-97fd-3caa2fcc11e0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9a2882ce-defd-4c67-9a91-b8321c3645e0","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"var a = 1;\n\nfunction a() {\n    return 2;\n}\n\nconsole.log(a); // 1","collabId":"ff7ea674-8186-49a7-82da-bff0a6a1cc89","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/语法/变量声明"],"createTime":1728969197271,"updateTime":1744040305126,"linkedCards":[{"id":505,"target":{"key":"card:505","type":"card","id":505},"summary":"let 声明的变量与其他语言声明的变量特性一致： 在变量声明之前不能使用 console.log(a); // ReferenceError: Cannot access 'a' before initialization let a = ...","tags":["JavaScript/语法/变量声明"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1744040305126}}